            "body": {
                "serial": "i600ec4ab74006",
                "body": "\n    <div class=\"grid-row\">\n      <div class=\"col-12\">\n        <h1>Graphic Associate Interaction</h1>\n        <h2>Match tools and materials</h2>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"grid-row\">\n      <div class=\"col-5\">\n        <p>Carpenters use many different tools and materials in their daily work, but not every tool is right for every task.\u00a0</p>\n        <p>The composite picture shows a selection of items that can be found in every workshop - can you match them up?</p>\n        <p>Build up to 4 pairs of tools and materials by clicking on the circles.</p>\n        <p>\u00a0</p>\n        {{i600ec4ab74430}}\n        <p>Picture by <a href=\"https://unsplash.com/photos/xzPMUMDDsfk\" target=\"_blank\">Joel &amp; Jasmin F\u00f8restbird</a>, released under the <a href=\"https://unsplash.com/license\" target=\"_blank\">Unsplash License</a>.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"col-1\"></div>\n      <div class=\"col-6\">\n        {{i600ec4ab7417b}}\n        <p>Composite picture by <a href=\"https://taotesting.com\" target=\"_blank\">O.A.T.</a>, released under <a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0\" target=\"_blank\">CC BY-SA 4.0</a>.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  ",
